    "• or after intercourse / blunt trauma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cy_pres_1_0",
   "x": 269,
   "y": 1052,
   "w": 212,
   "h": 228,
   "kind": "cy_w",
   "title": "Blood in the pelvis",
   "lines": [
    "• shoulder pain lying down",
    "• tenesmus",
    "• lightheaded",
    "• ORTHOSTATIC drop"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "dy_pres_0_0",
   "x": 521,
   "y": 802,
   "w": 212,
   "h": 202,
   "kind": "dy_t",
   "title": "CRAMPS on the first 1–2 days of flow",
   "lines": [
    "• radiate to the back",
    "• EASE as the period goes on"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "dy_pres_1_0",
   "x": 521,
   "y": 1026,
   "w": 212,
   "h": 254,
   "kind": "dy_w",
   "title": "Why it hurts",
   "lines": [
    "PROSTAGLANDINS → contractions → uterine ISCHEMIA",
    "~uterine pressure > arterial → anaerobic metabolites → type C pain fibres"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "en_pres_0_0",
   "x": 745,
   "y": 802,
   "w": 212,
   "h": 292,
   "kind": "en_t",
   "title": "Pain starting BEFORE menses",
   "lines": [
    "• dysmenorrhea",
    "• DEEP dyspareunia",
    "• dyschezia",
    "• dysuria",
    "• INFERTILITY",
    "• severity does NOT match the pain",
    "• YEARS undiagnosed: 'periods are painful'",
    "• case: 25, pain from 2 days BEFORE menses → leg, new deep dyspareunia"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "en_pres_1_0",
   "x": 745,
   "y": 1116,
   "w": 212,
   "h": 164,
   "kind": "en_w",
   "title": "Exam",
   "lines": [
    "• NODULAR uterosacral ligaments / cul-de-sac",
    "• FIXED uterus",
    "• adnexal mass (endometrioma)",
    "~• often NORMAL: does not rule it out"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ad_pres_0_0",
   "x": 969,
   "y": 802,
   "w": 212,
   "h": 264,
   "kind": "ad_t",
   "title": "HEAVY periods + pain",
   "lines": [
    "• MENORRHAGIA ± dysmenorrhea",
    "• heavy pelvic sensation",
    "• case: 42, parous, less pain but much HEAVIER despite continuous OCP"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ad_pres_1_0",
   "x": 969,
   "y": 1088,
   "w": 212,
   "h": 192,
   "kind": "ad_w",
   "title": "Exam",
   "lines": [
    "TENDER, ENLARGED, BOGGY uterus"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "le_pres_0_0",
   "x": 1193,
   "y": 802,
   "w": 212,
   "h": 242,
   "kind": "le_t",
   "title": "HEAVY bleeding · pressure",
   "lines": [
    "• #1 cause of AUB (submucosal most)",
    "• frequency, constipation",
    "• infertility if it DISTORTS THE CAVITY",
    "• DEGENERATION: pain, bleeding, pregnancy loss",
    "• risk: Black, obese, early menarche, family · SMOKING ↓ risk"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "le_pres_1_0",
   "x": 1193,
   "y": 1066,
   "w": 212,
   "h": 132,
   "kind": "le_w",
   "title": "Exam",
   "lines": [
    "ENLARGED (e.g. 20-week), MOBILE uterus · β-hCG negative",
    "case: 35, wants pregnancy, heavier periods, girth ↑"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "le_pres_2_0",
   "x": 1193,
   "y": 1220,
   "w": 212,
